  "definition": "Lobster Landing and Possession Limits",
  "effectiveDate": "2004-05-24",
  "historyNote": "#1878, eff 12-4-81; rpld by #2105, eff 8-1-82 New. #6594, eff 10-1-97; ss by #8088, EXEMPT, eff 5-24-04",
